sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant G as Core::Game
    participant CR as Core::ComponentRegistry
    participant PP as Bullet::BulletPlugin<br/>«IGamePluginService»
    participant BC as Bullet::BulletControlSystem
    participant W as Common::World
    participant PC as Player::PlayerControlSystem

    U->>G: press key 3 (Weapon component)
    G->>CR: toggle("Weapon", gameData, world)
    CR->>CR: component currently installed
    CR->>PP: stop(gameData, world)
    PP->>BC: setInstalled(false)
    PP->>W: removeEntity(each Bullet in flight)
    CR->>CR: activePlugins.removeAll(...)<br/>activeProcessors.removeAll(...)
    Note over CR,G: Next frame the loop simply<br/>iterates a shorter list
    U->>G: press SPACE
    G->>PC: process(gameData, world)
    PC->>BC: createBullet(player, gameData)
    BC-->>PC: Optional.empty()
    Note over PC: No weapon available , the Player<br/>component keeps running unaffected
    U->>G: press key 3 again
    G->>CR: toggle("Weapon", gameData, world)
    CR->>PP: start(gameData, world)
    PP->>BC: setInstalled(true)
    CR->>CR: activePlugins.addAll(...)<br/>activeProcessors.addAll(...)
    Note over U,PC: Firing resumes -- no recompilation,<br/>no JVM restart, no relinking of Core
